//
// Device-free check of DecodeInstsGen: the per-L instruction stream, with and
// without the readback-length patch (decode_L<N>.rb.insts.bin), and with the
// sliding-window start (decode_L<N>.sw.insts.bin).
//
// RUN: %PYTHON %S/check_decode_insts_gen.py | FileCheck %s
//
// CHECK: without .rb: readback stays at ATTN_MAXL: True
// CHECK: with .rb: readback follows ceil(L/16): True
// CHECK: identical .rb refused: True
// CHECK: missing .rb refused: True
// CHECK: missing .sw refused: True
// CHECK: with .sw: sliding readback starts where the window opens: True
// CHECK: identical .sw refused: True
